5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know the total cost upfront. No more surprise bills!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I hate losing days to travel. I want to see the ferry and train times.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who pays for what? I need to check the pricing structures to avoid disputes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I sleep badly. I need to know about the bathrooms and room layouts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I feel alone in groups. I want to understand how last year’s days actually ran.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the ferry takes two days, that’s half the trip gone!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, exactly. I’m checking the ferry sailings and the train time to the valley.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
