35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The offshore houses are 5,400 yen a head, but food is extra. That’s a hidden cost trap!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days total. The train to the valley is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,All-in rates charge the light eater the same as the big eater. That’s unfair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island houses have one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold. That’s a nightmare.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year, two of us didn’t meet between breakfast and dinner. We were together, but apart.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if we buy meals separately, I can control my own spending. No surprises!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is faster, but the city has separate rooms. I need to know the layout.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, separate rooms cost 8,000 yen more last time. The building rent is one bill.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, I felt that too. The shared house had no space to breathe. I need a door.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the shared house year was suffocating. I need a place where I can disappear.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, one bathroom is too much. I need to know if the city has private baths.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the city runs on trains every few minutes. No planning needed. That saves time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the city is flexible, but the costs are opaque. I need a fixed structure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I need a fixed mealtime. The inn serves dinner at six. That’s predictable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the inn has a timetable. The city has none. I need to know which feels less crowded.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I’m leaning towards the city. I can see the costs clearly if I book separately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The train is efficient. The city offers freedom. I’m voting for the city break.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The all-in rate is unfair. I prefer the city where I pay for what I eat.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"The inn has a routine, but the city has a door. I need that door.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The city allows me to be alone. The shared house did not. I need that space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
