70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I’m voting for Option C. I want to know the cost before I commit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m voting for Option C. The train is fast, and the city is easy to navigate.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I’m voting for Option C. The separate billing is fair and transparent.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
